for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026 revenue totaled $6.5 million and $12.8 million, respectively, compared to $5.7 million and $11.2 million, respectively, for the three and six months ended June 30, 2025. The increase of 13% and 14%, respectively, was primarily attributed to an increase in our managed IT services of 8% and 9%, respectively, compared to the prior year periods, as well as an increase in procurement revenue of 64% and 70%, respectively, compared to the prior year periods;

